        solution: 'After impact, energy is conserved on the swing: V = √(2gh) = √(2 × 9.8 × 0.12) = 1.53 m/s. During the impact, momentum is conserved: v = (2.010/0.010) × 1.53 = 308 m/s. Fraction of KE kept = m/(m + M) = 0.010/2.010 = 0.00498 — over 99% is lost in the impact.',
        calc: ['(2.010 / 0.010) * P.speedFromDrop(0.12)', 'P.KE(2.010, P.speedFromDrop(0.12)) / P.KE(0.010, (2.010 / 0.010) * P.speedFromDrop(0.12))'], answers: [308.3, 0.004975],
