        solution: 'Momentum: v₁′ + 2v₂′ = 6.0. Restitution: v₂′ − v₁′ = 0.60 × 6.0 = 3.6. Solving: v₂′ = 3.2 m/s, v₁′ = −0.40 m/s. KE before = 18 J; after = ½(1.0)(0.16) + ½(2.0)(10.24) = 0.08 + 10.24 = 10.32 J; lost = 7.68 J. Check: μ = 2/3 kg, ½(2/3)(36)(1 − 0.36) = 7.68 J ✓.',
